1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,380
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,604
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,604 --> 00:00:58,123
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,123 --> 00:00:59,553
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 14=

12
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,200
Mother!

13
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,441
Your Highness, Princess Consort.

14
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:10,761
How is she now?

15
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,361
Your Highness, Princess Consort,

16
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,761
the patient was highly emotional
earlier,

17
00:01:14,961 --> 00:01:15,481
and her pregnancy became unstable.

18
00:01:16,401 --> 00:01:17,961
The child is not yet full term.

19
00:01:18,361 --> 00:01:19,160
I'm afraid...

20
00:01:20,961 --> 00:01:22,441
Thank you for treating my mother,
Imperial Physician.

21
00:01:22,801 --> 00:01:23,600
I'll take it from here.

22
00:01:23,801 --> 00:01:25,281
I will take my leave.

23
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,401
Mother.

24
00:01:44,481 --> 00:01:45,441
Thank you.

25
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,401
If my mother were still
at Grand Tutor's Residence,

26
00:01:50,841 --> 00:01:53,401
Madam An would have used induced labor
as an excuse to kill her.

27
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,281
We still don't have solid proof of that.

28
00:01:57,921 --> 00:01:59,240
Who needs proof at this point?

29
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,761
If both mother and child had died,

30
00:02:00,841 --> 00:02:02,001
who would have benefited the most?

31
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:06,120
I thought they were wicked but cowardly.

32
00:02:06,361 --> 00:02:08,560
I assumed a warning would keep them
from trying again.

33
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:13,560
It's all my fault.

34
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,080
People's hearts are impossible
to fathom.

35
00:02:16,801 --> 00:02:18,001
You can't blame yourself.

36
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,560
Right now, the priority is
to deliver my mother's child.

37
00:02:25,481 --> 00:02:26,321
I'll go fetch the midwife.

38
00:02:26,841 --> 00:02:27,600
Wait.

39
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,600
I'll do it myself.

40
00:02:30,761 --> 00:02:31,321
Yeah.

41
00:02:31,921 --> 00:02:33,560
I need to prepare some things
for my mother

42
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,160
for a C-section.

43
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,841
Please step outside for now.

44
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:37,961
Don't worry.

45
00:02:47,481 --> 00:02:48,160
(Mother,)

46
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,361
(don't worry.)

47
00:02:50,481 --> 00:02:51,801
(I won't let anything happen to you.)

48
00:02:57,979 --> 00:03:04,965
(Spring's Tender Grace)

49
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:06,321
(Weiyue,)

50
00:03:07,441 --> 00:03:08,200
(no matter what,)

51
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:09,841
(I'm just glad you're back.)

52
00:03:11,881 --> 00:03:12,560
(Even if)

53
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,560
(it's not for me.)

54
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:23,481
Hey,

55
00:03:23,921 --> 00:03:24,680
how is the baby?

56
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:25,720
How is my son?

57
00:03:28,801 --> 00:03:30,441
Madam Bai had heavy bleeding.

58
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:33,001
Grand Tutor, I thought you were
so anxious

59
00:03:33,841 --> 00:03:36,441
because you were worried about
your wife's health.

60
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:40,520
Then... how is she?

61
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:41,640
Dead.

62
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:43,520
What?

63
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,640
What did you say?

64
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,361
They're both dead.

65
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:51,441
Are you satisfied now?

66
00:03:52,801 --> 00:03:54,401
Feng Weiyue!

67
00:03:57,200 --> 00:04:00,040
You killed your brother!

68
00:04:04,361 --> 00:04:06,040
My mother has been with you
for over ten years.

69
00:04:06,881 --> 00:04:08,640
And now all you care about is

70
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,321
that child you've never even met?

71
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,600
Get out.

72
00:04:12,361 --> 00:04:13,761
I don't want to see you right now!

73
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,120
You murderer.

74
00:04:17,801 --> 00:04:19,361
I won't let you get away with this!

75
00:04:19,361 --> 00:04:19,600
Get out!

76
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,481
Guards!

77
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,001
The Grand Tutor is tired.

78
00:04:22,881 --> 00:04:24,361
Escort him back to his residence
to rest.

79
00:04:24,761 --> 00:04:25,120
Understood.

80
00:04:25,961 --> 00:04:26,961
Grand Tutor,

81
00:04:27,321 --> 00:04:28,240
this way, please.

82
00:04:36,361 --> 00:04:38,240
My son!

83
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,720
My son!

84
00:04:47,401 --> 00:04:48,001
Are you all right?

85
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,520
Should I call the imperial physician?

86
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,200
I'm fine.

87
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,761
It's just low blood sugar.

88
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:56,001
Low blood sugar?

89
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,361
Then...

90
00:04:58,801 --> 00:04:59,921
Let me take you back to rest.

91
00:05:02,281 --> 00:05:02,921
Oh, right.

92
00:05:03,281 --> 00:05:04,921
Help me find a wet nurse for my brother.

93
00:05:09,481 --> 00:05:10,080
They...

94
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,881
They're both safe.

95
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,801
He's premature,

96
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,720
but healthy.

97
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,801
They're clearly alive,

98
00:05:25,361 --> 00:05:26,761
so why did you tell your father

99
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,040
that they were...

100
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,441
Because I wanted to give my mother
a chance

101
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,761
to see his true nature,

102
00:05:35,841 --> 00:05:37,600
a chance to choose again.

103
00:05:51,001 --> 00:05:52,361
Madam Bai and her son...

104
00:05:52,801 --> 00:05:53,720
They're dead.

105
00:05:53,921 --> 00:05:54,961
Both dead.

106
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,040
Qingyun,

107
00:05:56,281 --> 00:05:58,361
our good days are coming.

108
00:05:58,921 --> 00:06:00,080
What about Feng Weiyue?

109
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,120
As long as she's still breathing,

110
00:06:01,321 --> 00:06:02,520
she'll always be a threat.

111
00:06:03,801 --> 00:06:04,881
She's an outsider.

112
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,881
What waves can she make
in the Grand Tutor's Residence?

113
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:09,600
I heard Madam Bai was taken away
by Prince of Rong.

114
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,761
She died during treatment.

115
00:06:12,321 --> 00:06:13,520
Your father is quite

116
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,600
distressed about it.

117
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:17,361
There's no place for her
in the Grand Tutor's Residence anymore.

118
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,441
That makes sense, Mother.

119
00:06:19,881 --> 00:06:20,640
Learn from this.

120
00:06:20,881 --> 00:06:21,401
Alright.

121
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,560
Mother.

122
00:06:29,801 --> 00:06:30,761
Where's the child?

123
00:06:31,281 --> 00:06:32,520
Don't worry, Mother.

124
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,921
Mo Yuya found a wet nurse
for my brother.

125
00:06:35,441 --> 00:06:37,040
He just finished his milk
and fell asleep.

126
00:06:37,841 --> 00:06:38,401
Good.

127
00:06:39,281 --> 00:06:39,841
Good.

128
00:06:43,321 --> 00:06:43,961
By the way, Mother,

129
00:06:44,361 --> 00:06:46,680
you've made it through the worst,

130
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:48,841
but I still want to ask.

131
00:06:49,361 --> 00:06:50,680
Before you went into premature labor,

132
00:06:50,841 --> 00:06:51,680
what happened?

133
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,560
That day,

134
00:06:53,801 --> 00:06:55,281
Qingyun came to me in a hurry.

135
00:06:55,801 --> 00:06:57,281
She said you drowned yourself
in the pond.

136
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,441
I panicked, and that's how...

137
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,560
But Mother,

138
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,321
the signs of premature labor
in your pulse

139
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,801
weren't caused by emotion alone.

140
00:07:08,001 --> 00:07:09,481
Did you take any medicine before?

141
00:07:12,001 --> 00:07:13,160
Then...

142
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,881
Was there anything unusual in your food?

143
00:07:17,361 --> 00:07:18,441
I think...

144
00:07:20,441 --> 00:07:23,001
For the past month, there was always
an extra dish of scrambled eggs.

145
00:07:24,321 --> 00:07:27,001
Did the scrambled eggs
taste slightly pungent?

146
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,441
Castor oil scrambled eggs?

147
00:07:33,761 --> 00:07:35,600
That dish was used to induce labor.

148
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,281
What?

149
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,240
Mother,

150
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,520
don't worry.

151
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,921
Whoever picked on you,

152
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,520
I'll make them all pay.

153
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,680
Princess Consort,

154
00:07:48,921 --> 00:07:50,881
the movements of your family lately
are plain to see.

155
00:07:51,281 --> 00:07:52,080
You don't even need me

156
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:52,841
to investigate in secret.

157
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,361
The neighbors all know.

158
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,881
They're arranging a funeral?

159
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,200
No.

160
00:07:58,401 --> 00:07:59,481
These past few days,

161
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,720
they decorated with lanterns
and hosted a grand banquet

162
00:08:02,281 --> 00:08:05,160
to celebrate Feng Qingyun being taken
as the Grand Princess's sworn sister

163
00:08:05,401 --> 00:08:06,640
and becoming an imperial relative
overnight.

164
00:08:07,281 --> 00:08:08,160
It's also to celebrate

165
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,080
that Madam An's status has risen along,

166
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:12,240
and she's been promoted to
principal wife of the Grand Tutor.

167
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,761
It's only been three days,

168
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,040
and they're already throwing
a grand banquet.

169
00:08:16,681 --> 00:08:19,240
Why would the Grand Princess
suddenly take a sworn sister?

170
00:08:20,961 --> 00:08:23,040
It seems she's involved in this too.

171
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,561
Everyone, let's drink.

172
00:08:25,601 --> 00:08:27,280
Congratulations!

173
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,601
Congratulations!

174
00:08:28,601 --> 00:08:30,561
The Feng family truly has
one happy event after another.

175
00:08:30,561 --> 00:08:31,841
Oh.

176
00:08:31,961 --> 00:08:33,240
Oh, congratulations!

177
00:08:33,881 --> 00:08:34,561
Madam An,

178
00:08:34,681 --> 00:08:37,001
Feng Weiyue suddenly barged into
your room and searched everywhere.

179
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,881
She's heading to the main hall now.

180
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,320
Stop her.

181
00:08:40,601 --> 00:08:43,080
Whatever it takes,
don't let her ruin today's banquet.

182
00:08:43,681 --> 00:08:46,681
Madam An, are you afraid to face me
because you've done so much wrong?

183
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,881
Today is Qingyun's big day.

184
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,360
May I ask what you mean by this,
Princess Consort?

185
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:59,040
Madam An, why are you
playing dumb like this?

186
00:08:59,561 --> 00:09:01,360
Of course I'm here to
settle the score with you.

187
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,841
Everyone, please leave.

188
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,761
We have some family business
to deal with.

189
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,240
Pei Chen, Qian Ning.

190
00:09:15,841 --> 00:09:17,320
A show this good

191
00:09:17,681 --> 00:09:19,120
shouldn't go without an audience.

192
00:09:19,761 --> 00:09:20,961
What's going on?

193
00:09:21,601 --> 00:09:22,160
This...

194
00:09:22,521 --> 00:09:23,440
What does this mean?

195
00:09:23,801 --> 00:09:24,961
What are they doing?

196
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:25,761
Weiyue,

197
00:09:25,961 --> 00:09:28,280
today is my big day.

198
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,921
Please don't make trouble here.

199
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,561
Well, well,

200
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,721
now you care about your prestige?

201
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:33,921
Too late.

202
00:09:34,841 --> 00:09:35,641
Ungrateful girl!

203
00:09:37,881 --> 00:09:38,881
What are you making a scene about?

204
00:09:39,921 --> 00:09:41,240
Glad that everyone's here now.

205
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:42,721
Yuqin,

206
00:09:43,961 --> 00:09:44,721
tell them.

207
00:09:45,801 --> 00:09:47,320
Back then, how did Madam An

208
00:09:47,801 --> 00:09:49,240
force you

209
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,521
to use musk to make my mother miscarry?

210
00:09:53,001 --> 00:09:54,921
Madam An took my little sister.

211
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,480
I had no choice but to work
with the coachman, Ma Zhen.

212
00:09:58,001 --> 00:09:59,841
She made us put musk

213
00:09:59,841 --> 00:10:00,801
on Madam Bai's underclothes

214
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,681
and make her miscarry without a trace.

215
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,160
You...

216
00:10:04,641 --> 00:10:06,080
My dear, please.

217
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:08,120
You can't listen to
this girl's one-sided story.

218
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,240
She's in league with Feng Weiyue!

219
00:10:10,721 --> 00:10:11,400
I believe

220
00:10:11,761 --> 00:10:14,440
the amount of musk used
in the residence must be recorded.

221
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,921
And a lot of hush money was needed.

222
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,240
So where did that money

223
00:10:18,721 --> 00:10:19,721
come from?

224
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,120
I think

225
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,801
the pawnshop
should be a good place to look.

226
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,521
Isn't that right, Madam An?

227
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,400
Take a good look.

228
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:30,360
(Pawn Ticket, Holder: An Mingru)
Your name is on this pawn ticket.

229
00:10:30,561 --> 00:10:31,801
An Mingru.

230
00:10:32,921 --> 00:10:35,360
I'll leave the castor oil scrambled eggs
out of this for now.

231
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:39,961
My dear,

232
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:40,801
I didn't do it!

233
00:10:40,801 --> 00:10:42,601
You have to believe me!

234
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,761
I warned you before.

235
00:10:44,761 --> 00:10:46,641
But you showed no remorse
and deceived my mother.

236
00:10:46,801 --> 00:10:49,120
She mistakenly thought
I had fallen into the pond,

237
00:10:49,641 --> 00:10:51,761
and the shock caused her
to miscarry and die.

238
00:10:52,601 --> 00:10:53,841
She was careless herself.

239
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,601
How can you blame me?

240
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,400
I saw it.

241
00:10:57,881 --> 00:10:58,601
Back then,

242
00:10:58,601 --> 00:11:00,320
it was Miss Feng Qingyun
who told Madam Bai

243
00:11:00,841 --> 00:11:03,561
that she saw someone who looked like
my lady jump into the pond.

244
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:07,080
You wretch! Why are you framing me?

245
00:11:07,561 --> 00:11:08,521
Enough!

246
00:11:08,841 --> 00:11:09,961
Haven't you been humiliated enough?

247
00:11:10,561 --> 00:11:11,001
Yuqin,

248
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,480
get up.

249
00:11:13,561 --> 00:11:14,160
My dear,

250
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:16,400
I'm innocent!

251
00:11:16,967 --> 00:11:17,440
Mother!

252
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,921
- Your crimes are unforgivable.
- Mother.

253
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:21,120
My household can no longer keep you.

254
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,160
From this moment on,

255
00:11:22,601 --> 00:11:23,961
you're expelled from it!

256
00:11:24,561 --> 00:11:26,440
My dear!

257
00:11:28,601 --> 00:11:30,240
Feng Weiyue,

258
00:11:30,801 --> 00:11:32,521
I'll kill you!

259
00:11:32,921 --> 00:11:34,641
I'll kill you!

260
00:11:36,961 --> 00:11:37,801
Mother!

261
00:11:38,881 --> 00:11:39,721
Mother!

262
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:42,881
Mother!

263
00:11:44,721 --> 00:11:45,440
Mother!

264
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,200
Qingyun,

265
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,400
I can't accept this.

266
00:11:49,978 --> 00:11:50,721
Mother!

267
00:11:50,721 --> 00:11:51,841
I can't.

268
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:53,881
Mother?

269
00:11:54,801 --> 00:11:56,320
Mother!

270
00:12:17,961 --> 00:12:18,801
Are you all right?

271
00:12:23,881 --> 00:12:25,360
Everything here is settled.

272
00:12:25,841 --> 00:12:27,040
Let me take you back.

273
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,240
Wait.

274
00:12:29,881 --> 00:12:31,200
I have a few words

275
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,921
I want to say to the Grand Tutor.

276
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,881
Actually, my mother didn't die.

277
00:12:41,721 --> 00:12:44,320
She gave birth safely
to a healthy child.

278
00:12:44,641 --> 00:12:45,641
A boy.

279
00:12:46,841 --> 00:12:47,521
However,

280
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,681
he will never know

281
00:12:49,681 --> 00:12:50,721
that he has a father like you.

282
00:12:51,601 --> 00:12:52,641
Like my mother, he will take

283
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,921
the surname Bai.

284
00:12:55,001 --> 00:12:55,841
I will make sure

285
00:12:56,961 --> 00:13:00,360
you never see him in this lifetime.

286
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,160
Your Highness,

287
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,961
Feng Weiyue stole the man I love.

288
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:29,040
Now she's killed my mother.

289
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,040
That makes her my sworn enemy.

290
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:33,961
As long as you avenge me,

291
00:13:34,681 --> 00:13:36,841
I'm willing to pay any price.

292
00:13:39,681 --> 00:13:41,801
Just to deal with Feng Weiyue?

293
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,681
Is it worth it?

294
00:13:45,841 --> 00:13:48,120
Your Highness, I know
you have grand ambitions.

295
00:13:48,561 --> 00:13:50,641
I'm also willing to help you
achieve great things.

296
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:53,120
I only ask that
on the day you rise to power,

297
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:56,120
you hand Feng Weiyue over to me.

298
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:01,120
Then are you truly willing
to pay any price?

299
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,360
I would die a thousand deaths
without regret.

300
00:14:02,601 --> 00:14:03,360
Good.

301
00:14:04,561 --> 00:14:06,521
I have a friend named Du Wei.

302
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,561
Because of the water transport matter,

303
00:14:08,681 --> 00:14:10,681
he and I have fallen out.

304
00:14:10,961 --> 00:14:12,561
Would you be willing

305
00:14:12,761 --> 00:14:14,841
to go and comfort him for me?

306
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:34,280
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

307
00:14:34,487 --> 00:14:36,800
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

308
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,840
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

309
00:14:41,327 --> 00:14:43,647
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

310
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:47,640
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

311
00:14:48,207 --> 00:14:50,440
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

312
00:14:51,573 --> 00:14:56,053
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

313
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:01,320
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

314
00:15:01,953 --> 00:15:04,640
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

315
00:15:05,814 --> 00:15:08,440
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

316
00:15:08,793 --> 00:15:11,000
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

317
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:15,160
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

318
00:15:15,513 --> 00:15:17,880
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

319
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:19,800
♪This love remains unchanged♪

320
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:23,320
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

321
00:15:25,053 --> 00:15:27,493
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

322
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:31,560
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

323
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:34,360
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

324
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,260
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

325
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:38,000
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

326
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,360
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

327
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:45,680
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

328
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,040
♪I don't regret that vow♪

329
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:51,520
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
